abstract: "Documentary comparison of 31 US fall detection and medical alert providers and carriers: 1121 source-quoted claims on who is called after a fall, family call order, no-answer behavior, fees, contracts, trials, returns and battery. KeepOkey publishes the index and offers a fall detection watch; no record is a product test."
